  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C → F: x * 9/5 + 32</p>\n    <p class=\"formula\">F → C: (x - 32) * 5/9</p>\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius to Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit to Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n    <button id=\"convert\">Convert</button>\n    <p class=\"result-label\">Result</p>\n    <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">--</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\n:root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --input-bg: #0f3460;\n  --border: #533483;\n  --shadow: #0b0b1a;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--shadow);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.3rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--shadow);\n}\n\n.formula {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--border);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\ninput, select {\n  background: var(--input-bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 10px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  outline: none;\n  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--shadow);\n  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ff5c77;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--shadow);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  background: var(--input-bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  min-height: 2.5rem;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const temperatureInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst directionSelect = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = temperatureInput.value.trim();\n  const num = Number(raw);\n\n  if (raw === '' || !Number.isFinite(num)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let result;\n  if (directionSelect.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    result = num * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    result = (num - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n\n  resultOutput.textContent = result.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\n\ntemperatureInput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n    convert();\n  }\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA retro pixel-art styled temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Works fully offline.\n\n## Features\n\n- Convert Celsius to Fahrenheit and vice versa\n- Pixel-art aesthetic with a cohesive dark palette\n- Keyboard accessible: press Enter in the input to convert\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide\n- No external dependencies, packages, or network requests\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a numeric temperature in the input field.\n3. Select the conversion direction from the dropdown.\n4. Click **Convert** or press **Enter**.\n5. The result appears with exactly two decimal places, without units.\n\nInvalid or empty input displays `Error`.\n\n## File Structure\n\n- `index.html` — markup and controls\n- `style.css` — pixel-art theme and responsive layout\n- `script.js` — conversion logic and event handling\n- `README.md` — this file\n\n## Notes\n\n- The result output uses `toFixed(2)` for consistent formatting.\n- Input is validated with `Number.isFinite` to reject `NaN`, `Infinity`, and empty strings.\n- All styling uses CSS; no images or external assets are loaded.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
